B.B.5. ambar!-ra |HI.SUHUR| suhur{ku₆} [...]
#lem: ambar[reed-bed]; HI.SUHUR[fish]; suhur[carp]; X
#tr.en: ……, …… the marshes with various carp, 
#etcsl: line-id=B.B.5

B.B.6. %e mu-gi-e %s gi sumun gi [henbur ...]
#lem: mugi[thicket]; gi[reed]; sumun[old]; gi[reed]; henbur[stalk]; X
#tr.en: ……, …… the reedbeds with mature and fresh reeds, 
