B.B.7. tir-tir-e šeg₉ [šeg₉-bar ...]
#lem: tir[forest]; šeg[an animal]; šeŋbar[an animal]; X
#tr.en: ……, …… the woods with fallow deer and wild sheep, 
#etcsl: line-id=B.B.7

B.B.8. an-edin-na %e {mu}maš-gurum!# [...]
#lem: aneden[the high steppe]; mašgurum[plant]; X
#tr.en: ……, …… the high desert with @fsux{mašgurum} bushes, 
