B.B.9. pu₂-kiri₆ lal₃ ŋeštin# [...]
#lem: pukiri[irrigated orchard]; lal[syrup]; ŋeštin[vine]; X
#tr.en: ……, …… the irrigated orchards with syrup and wine, 
#etcsl: line-id=B.B.9

B.B.10. mu-sar-re hi-iz{sar} [za₃-hi-li]{[sar]} [...]
#lem: musar[garden]; hiz[vegetable]; zahili[plant]; X
#tr.en: ……, …… the garden plots with lettuce and cress, 
